Usage: agent-deck events publish --kind macapp.<name> [--session <id>] [--data <json> | --data-file <path|->] [--json]
Needs [macapp] plugins = true, except built-in macapp.open and macapp.open.ack.
  -data string
    	JSON object payload
  -data-file string
    	read the JSON payload from this file, or - for stdin
  -json
    	print {ok, kind, session_id, cursor} as JSON
  -kind string
    	frame kind; must be in the macapp.* namespace
  -session string
    	session id the frame is about (default: the current session, $AGENTDECK_INSTANCE_ID)
